{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01JzkY4Re9iqghs5M4qF9S3K","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the task. I need to:\n\n1. Read the workflow, format rules, citations rules, and audit rules\n2. Read the source files (which are audited sessions with per-paragraph audit footnotes)\n3. Identify LOW and MEDIUM confidence gaps\n4. Research those gaps using web sources\n5. Produce an improved manuscript with all paragraphs audited\n6. Write the enhanced manuscript to the output file\n\nLet me start by reading all the relevant files in parallel.\n\nThe paths are:\n- MANIFEST: /home/averri/github/tools/tito-examples/research/smoketest/sessions/run-20260330_182635/manifest.json\n\n\n- TASK: /home/averri/github/tools/tito-examples/research/smoketest/tasks/task.enhance.md\n- OUTPUT: /home/averri/github/tools/tito-examples/research/smoketest/sessions/run-20260330_182635/sm1_enh.enhance.md\n- KB: /home/averri/github/tools/tito-examples/research/smoketest/kb\n- SOURCES: ../run-20260330_175103/sm1.prompt.md, ../run-20260330_175309_7976/sm1.research.md, ../run-20260330_182313/sm1\n\n_rev.review.md\n- WORKFLOW: /usr/local/libexec/tito/workflows/enhance.session.md\n- FORMAT_RULES: /usr/local/libexec/tito/rules/format.session.md\n- CITATIONS_RULES: /usr/local/libexec/tito/rules/citations.enhance.md\n- AUDIT_RULES: /usr/local/libexec/tito/rules/audit.md\n\nI'm resolving the relative source paths against the session base directory to get the full paths for the input files I'll be working with.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13621,"cache_read_input_tokens":16297,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":13621,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"249e2e93-5ddb-4b1b-a788-8df9e70b5896","